        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lat nath kɛ dueer",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min pal Ɛdhra kä latdɛ dueer, wieeɛ kä duäcɛ rɔ piny nhiam luaak Kuɔth. Cu buɔ̱n mi di̱i̱t wutni kɛ män kɛ gaat rɔ̱ ma̱t jɛ kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Cukɛ wiee ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cɛ-kɛ̈n-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣi-el kä gaat Ee-lam ruac kɛ Ɛdhra wëë i̱, “Cakɔ thil luth kɛ Kuothda kɛ ɣöö ca̱kɔ kuɛɛn kɛ män kä nɛy kɔ̱kiɛn. A cäŋɛ niɛ täämɛ ŋotdɛ te ŋa̱th thi̱n kɛ kui̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ latnɛ mat ruac kɛ Kuothdan ɛn ɣöö banɛ mänkɔn kɛ gaatkiɛn kɛɛl däk, ce̱tkɛ ruacdu yɛnɛ nɛy tin luɔ̱thkɛ luëëk Kuɔthdan. A jɛ la̱tkɛ ce̱tnikɛ ŋuɔ̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jiɛc rɔ, bumni latni jɛ. Kɛ ɣöö ɛ la̱tdu bakɔ ji̱ luäk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Ɛdhra rɔ jiɛc, kä cuɛ bööth palä kɛnɛ ji̱ Lii-bay kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal jak kä yackɛ rɔ ɛn ɣöö ba la̱t ce̱tkɛ min ca lar kä cukɛ rɔ yac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛdhra rɔ woc thok luaak Kuɔth, kä cuɛ wä niɛn duëël Yɛ-ɣo-ɣa-nan gat Ɛl-ya-cib /kenɛ mi̱th kä /kenɛ math kɛ pi̱w. Parɛ thil ŋäthä pɛ̈ɛ̈cni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua ruac lat raar kä Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm ɛn ɣöö nɛy diaal tëë luny jɔk pe̱cä akɛ duɔlkɛ rɔ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram wä tey a /ci bi ben kɛ kɛn ni̱n da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, ce̱tkɛ ruac bööthni kɛnɛ kua̱r ba kuakɛ diaal ka̱n, kä ba puɔ̱nydɛ tuɔ̱k raar rɛy dolä pɛ̈ɛ̈cni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ cäŋ kä jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw kä pay bäŋuan, cu ji̱ Juda kɛnɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min diaal rɔ̱ dol kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ kɛn ni̱n da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. Kä cu nɛy diaal nyuur dɛɛkä thok Luaak Kuɔth dualkɛ kɛ kui̱ dolä kɛnɛ nhiaal mi di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bo̱o̱th palä ni Ɛdhra rɔ jiɛc kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Cia duer la̱t cia kuɛɛn kɛ män ti jur, cia duer nööŋ kä I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ la̱tdɛ dueerkun Kuoth Nhial Kuoth guurikun, kä la̱tdɛ ruacdɛ. Kuɔcɛ rɔ̱ rɛy ji̱ wec kɛnɛ mänkun ti Jur ti̱ti̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu duɔl kɛɛliw ɛ loc kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t i̱, “Ɛ jɛn luɔtdɛ. Bakɔ la̱t ce̱tnikɛ mɔ ci larɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö ŋuan naath, kä tëë kɛ nhiaal mi di̱i̱t. /Cakɔ rɔ bi luäŋ kɛ cuɔ̱ŋ dɛɛkä. Kɛ ɣöö ɛn nɛmɛ /ciɛ la̱t ca̱ŋ kɛl kiɛ ni̱n rɛw. Kɛ ɣöö cakɔ duer ɛlɔ̱ŋ kä nɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ bööthkɔ cuŋ kɛ gua̱a̱th dolä kɛɛliw. A nɛy diaal rɛy wi̱i̱nikɔ tin ci kuɛɛn kɛ män ti jur bäkɛ cäŋ in ca lat, kɛɛl kɛ bööth kɛnɛ ruëëc wec ɔ, amäni mi ci waŋ lɔaac Kuɔth kɛ nɛmɛ jiɛn kä kɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua ni Jo-na-than gat Ä-tha-el kɛnɛ Yɛ̈-dhɛ-yaa gat Tik-waa cu jɛ gak tɔ̱, kä cukɛ mat kɛ Mɛ-cu-lam kɛnɛ raan Lii-bay ni Cɛ̈-bɛ-thay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy tin luny jɔk pe̱cä ruac ɛmɔ nhɔk. Kä cu bo̱o̱th palä ni Ɛdhra naath kuany kä bööth thukni duëli kä cuɛ ciöötkiɛn gɔ̱r. Kä kɛ cäŋ in jio̱l kä pay wäl cukɛ la̱t kä mɛmɛ tok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ cäŋ in nhiam kä pay in jio̱l cukɛ thuɔ̱k kɛ lieny nɛɛni tin ci kuɛɛn kɛ män ti jur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nɛy tin ci duer kɛ kuen mään ti jur",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ti̱ti̱ a ciööt nɛɛni tin ci kuɛɛn kɛ män ti jur rɛy kuayni bööthni palä. Kä kuay Yɛ-cuwä gat Yo-dha-dak kɛnɛ gaat man. Cua Mɛ̈-the-yaa kɛnɛ Ɛ-li-dhɛr, kɛ Ya-rib kɛnɛ Gɛ-dɛ̈l-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ jɛ lar i̱ bikɛ mänkiɛn däk, kä cukɛ dɔdɛ̈ɛ̈l thöp ala muc kɛ kui̱ dui̱rädiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kuay I-mer. Cua Ɣä-na-ni kɛnɛ Dhɛ-bɛ̈d-yaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
